{"id":"977206e3aed8645d","group":"20","path":"20/20-cor-countable-ideal-exact-pair.md","title":"可数度理想的精确对","display":"cor-countable-ideal-exact-pair — 可数度理想的精确对","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-cor-countable-ideal-exact-pair","aliases":["20-cor-countable-ideal-exact-pair"],"display":"cor-countable-ideal-exact-pair — 可数度理想的精确对","chapter":"6","section":"6.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.5.12","source_printed_pages":[144],"source_pdf_pages":[178],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-exact-pair]]","[[20-df-degle]]","[[20-df-join]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-cor-countable-ideal-exact-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-cor-countable-ideal-exact-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-countable-ideal-exact-pair — 可数度理想的精确对"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.5.12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>144</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>178</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f1ca4420af66074c\" href=\"?note=f1ca4420af66074c\" title=\"20-thm-exact-pair\">20-thm-exact-pair</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathcal D\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathcal D\\)</span> 是非空至多可数集合，向下封闭且对二元 join 封闭：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf c\\in I\\Rightarrow\\mathbf d\\in I\">\\(\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf c\\in I\\Rightarrow\\mathbf d\\in I\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf c,\\mathbf d\\in I\\Rightarrow\\mathbf c\\vee\\mathbf d\\in I\">\\(\\mathbf c,\\mathbf d\\in I\\Rightarrow\\mathbf c\\vee\\mathbf d\\in I\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f1ca4420af66074c\" href=\"?note=f1ca4420af66074c\" title=\"20-thm-exact-pair\">20-thm-exact-pair</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}countable\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}exact\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\ \\forall\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\mathbf d\\in I\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf c)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}countable\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}exact\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\ \\forall\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\mathbf d\\in I\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf c)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbf i_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\">\\((\\mathbf i_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\)</span>，有限情形允许重复。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a_n=\\mathbf i_0\\vee\\cdots\\vee\\mathbf i_n\">\\(\\mathbf a_n=\\mathbf i_0\\vee\\cdots\\vee\\mathbf i_n\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbf a_n)\">\\((\\mathbf a_n)\\)</span> 递增、均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 成员不超过某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a_n\">\\(\\mathbf a_n\\)</span>。取该序列的精确对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\">\\(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的每个成员是两边下度；反之共同下度不超过某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a_n\\in I\">\\(\\mathbf a_n\\in I\\)</span>，由向下封闭属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>。序列无需有效枚举。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 6.5.12；印刷页 144；PDF 第 178 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-exact-pair","status":"resolved","id":"f1ca4420af66074c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-exact-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-degle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-exact-pair","status":"resolved","id":"f1ca4420af66074c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-exact-pair]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false},{"ta